# World Bake Pipeline — Complete

Engine 1.0 cores untouched. Bake plugs into the existing **column stage** only.

## Bake architecture

```
Seed → InfiniteNoiseWorld generators
     → WorldBakeService.bake_world(radius)   # pure base columns
     → user://world_bakes/v1_s{seed}_r{R}/world.bake

Stream load:
  SNAPSHOT (WorldState) → COLUMN prefer bake → MESH → BUFFER → APPLY
```

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `world/world_bake_service.gd` | Bake, serialize, load, version+checksum, apply base+overlays |
| `chunks/chunk_pipeline.gd` | Prefer bake on full rebuild; `column_source` telemetry |
| `chunks/chunk_manager.gd` | Bootstrap: load bake if present; optional bake-on-new |
| `scripts/verify_world_bake.gd` | Dedicated suite (registered) |

**WorldState** remains sole authority for digs/builds/features/towns/crystal. Bake is **immutable base only**. Outside finite radius → generate as today.

**Env:** `CRYSTALSTORM_WORLD_BAKE=0` disables prefer; `CRYSTALSTORM_BAKE_ON_NEW=1` bakes on first miss; `CRYSTALSTORM_BAKE_RADIUS=N` sets bounds.

