## What was missing

Mesh plans were only force-baked in the verify harness — not co-emitted by world bake, and not populated on production bootstrap.

## Fixes

| Gap | Fix |
|-----|-----|
| Plans not in world bake | `bake_world(world, rad, host)` runs `MeshPlanCache.bake_plans`; `save_bake` writes `mesh_plans.v1` next to `world.bake` |
| Cold start never preferred cache | `bootstrap_for_world(world, force, host)` loads columns then `ensure_mesh_plans` (load or backfill); ChunkManager passes `self` as host |
| Main launch silent | Logs `[MeshPlanCache] mode=loaded\|baked`; seed 12349 now has both files |
| Verify only force-bake | Asserts co-emit, `ensure_mesh_plans` backfill, bootstrap prefer `mesh_source=cache` without special env |

